  "title": "Slow Cooker Chicken with Apples and Honey",
  "description": "Sweetened with honey and apples and spiced with cinnamon and cumin, this chicken and potato slow cooker meal is perfect for fall.",
  "authors": [
    "Kimberly Ann"
  ],
